{"seq":3,"slug":"column-family","title":"列族存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/nosql-and-newdb/column-family","wordCount":781,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"列族存储\">列族存储</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>列族存储（Column-Family Store）是一种面向大规模分布式场景的 NoSQL 数据模型。数据按列族（Column Family）组织，同一列族的数据物理上存储在一起。这种设计特别适合写密集型工作负载和宽表模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 行存储&#10;        R[Row: [id, name, age, email, phone]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 列族存储&#10;        CF1[&quot;列族 basic: {name, age}&quot;]&#10;        CF2[&quot;列族 contact: {email, phone}&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 行存储\n        R[Row: [id, name, age, email, phone]\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 列族存储\n        CF1[\"列族 basic: {name, age}\"]\n        CF2[\"列族 contact: {email, phone}\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>列族存储</th>\n<th>关系数据库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据模型</td>\n<td>行键 → 列族 → 列</td>\n<td>表 → 行 → 列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema</td>\n<td>列族预定义，列动态</td>\n<td>严格预定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展方式</td>\n<td>水平扩展（原生）</td>\n<td>主要垂直扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入性能</td>\n<td>极高（LSM-Tree）</td>\n<td>中等（B+ 树）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询方式</td>\n<td>按行键范围扫描</td>\n<td>SQL 灵活查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>海量数据、高吞吐写入</td>\n<td>复杂查询、事务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"apache-cassandra\">Apache Cassandra</h2><p>Cassandra 是一个高可用、无中心的分布式列族数据库，最初由 Facebook 开发。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据模型\">数据模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Cassandra CQL（类 SQL 语法）&#10;CREATE KEYSPACE ecommerce&#10;WITH replication = {&#10;    &#39;class&#39;: &#39;NetworkTopologyStrategy&#39;,&#10;    &#39;dc1&#39;: 3, &#39;dc2&#39;: 3&#10;};&#10;&#10;USE ecommerce;&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE user_activity (&#10;    user_id     UUID,&#10;    activity_ts TIMESTAMP,&#10;    event_type  TEXT,&#10;    details     MAP&lt;TEXT, TEXT&gt;,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (user_id, activity_ts)&#10;) WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (activity_ts DESC);&#10;&#10;-- 插入数据&#10;INSERT INTO user_activity (user_id, activity_ts, event_type, details)&#10;VALUES (uuid(), toTimestamp(now()), &#39;page_view&#39;,&#10;    {&#39;page&#39;: &#39;/products/123&#39;, &#39;duration&#39;: &#39;45s&#39;});&#10;&#10;-- 查询：按用户查询最近活动&#10;SELECT * FROM user_activity&#10;WHERE user_id = ? AND activity_ts &gt; &#39;2024-01-01&#39;&#10;LIMIT 50;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Cassandra CQL（类 SQL 语法）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KEYSPACE ecommerce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replication </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'class'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NetworkTopologyStrategy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'dc1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dc2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ecommerce;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> user_activity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id     UUID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    activity_ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_type  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    details     MAP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (user_id, activity_ts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CLUSTERING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (activity_ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 插入数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_activity (user_id, activity_ts, event_type, details)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (uuid(), toTimestamp(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'page_view'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'page'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/products/123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'duration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'45s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询：按用户查询最近活动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2024-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cassandra-架构\">Cassandra 架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Cassandra Ring&#10;        N1[Node 1: Token 0-25]&#10;        N2[Node 2: Token 26-50]&#10;        N3[Node 3: Token 51-75]&#10;        N4[Node 4: Token 76-100]&#10;        N1 --&gt; N2 --&gt; N3 --&gt; N4 --&gt; N1&#10;    end&#10;    C[Client] --&gt; N1&#10;    C --&gt; N3\">graph TD\n    subgraph Cassandra Ring\n        N1[Node 1: Token 0-25]\n        N2[Node 2: Token 26-50]\n        N3[Node 3: Token 51-75]\n        N4[Node 4: Token 76-100]\n        N1 --&gt; N2 --&gt; N3 --&gt; N4 --&gt; N1\n    end\n    C[Client] --&gt; N1\n    C --&gt; N3</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Cassandra</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构</td>\n<td>无主节点，对等架构（P2P）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>可调一致性（ONE/QUORUM/ALL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分区</td>\n<td>一致性哈希 + 虚拟节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复制</td>\n<td>跨数据中心复制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入路径</td>\n<td>CommitLog → MemTable → SSTable</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"一致性级别\">一致性级别</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ONE</td>\n<td>一个副本确认即返回</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QUORUM</td>\n<td>多数副本确认</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LOCAL_QUORUM</td>\n<td>本地数据中心多数确认</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>本地强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALL</td>\n<td>所有副本确认</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"apache-hbase\">Apache HBase</h2><p>HBase 是基于 Hadoop HDFS 的分布式列族数据库，适合超大规模数据存储和实时随机访问。</p>\n<h3 id=\"hbase-数据模型\">HBase 数据模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"RowKey → Column Family → Column Qualifier → Timestamp → Value&#10;&#10;示例：&#10;Row: &quot;user:1001&quot;&#10;  CF &quot;info&quot;:&#10;    &quot;name&quot; → &quot;alice&quot; (ts: 1704067200)&#10;    &quot;age&quot;  → &quot;28&quot;    (ts: 1704067200)&#10;  CF &quot;contact&quot;:&#10;    &quot;email&quot; → &quot;alice@example.com&quot; (ts: 1704067200)&#10;    &quot;phone&quot; → &quot;138xxxx&quot;           (ts: 1704153600)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>RowKey → Column Family → Column Qualifier → Timestamp → Value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>示例：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Row: \"user:1001\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  CF \"info\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"name\" → \"alice\" (ts: 1704067200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"age\"  → \"28\"    (ts: 1704067200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  CF \"contact\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"email\" → \"alice@example.com\" (ts: 1704067200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"phone\" → \"138xxxx\"           (ts: 1704153600)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"hbase-vs-cassandra\">HBase vs Cassandra</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>HBase</th>\n<th>Cassandra</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构</td>\n<td>Master-Slave（HMaster）</td>\n<td>无中心（P2P）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底层存储</td>\n<td>HDFS</td>\n<td>本地磁盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>强一致（单行）</td>\n<td>可调一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入性能</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维复杂度</td>\n<td>高（依赖 ZooKeeper、HDFS）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>Hadoop 生态、大数据分析</td>\n<td>高可用写密集应用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"宽表模型设计\">宽表模型设计</h2><p>列族存储的表设计与关系数据库截然不同——需要根据<strong>查询模式</strong>来设计表结构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"设计原则\">设计原则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查询驱动设计</td>\n<td>先确定查询模式，再设计表结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反规范化</td>\n<td>为不同查询创建不同的表（数据冗余）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行键设计至关重要</td>\n<td>行键决定数据分布和查询效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免热点</td>\n<td>行键不要以时间戳开头（导致写入热点）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Cassandra：为不同查询创建不同的表&#10;-- 查询1：按用户查订单&#10;CREATE TABLE orders_by_user (&#10;    user_id    UUID,&#10;    order_id   UUID,&#10;    order_date TIMESTAMP,&#10;    total      DECIMAL,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (user_id, order_date)&#10;) WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (order_date DESC);&#10;&#10;-- 查询2：按日期查订单&#10;CREATE TABLE orders_by_date (&#10;    order_date DATE,&#10;    order_id   UUID,&#10;    user_id    UUID,&#10;    total      DECIMAL,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (order_date, order_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Cassandra：为不同查询创建不同的表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询1：按用户查订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders_by_user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id    UUID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id   UUID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (user_id, order_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CLUSTERING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询2：按日期查订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders_by_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id   UUID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id    UUID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_date, order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"时间序列数据\">时间序列数据</h2><p>列族存储天然适合时间序列数据场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Cassandra 时间序列表设计&#10;CREATE TABLE sensor_data (&#10;    sensor_id  TEXT,&#10;    bucket     DATE,&#10;    event_ts   TIMESTAMP,&#10;    temperature DOUBLE,&#10;    humidity   DOUBLE,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY ((sensor_id, bucket), event_ts)&#10;) WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (event_ts DESC)&#10;  AND compaction = {&#39;class&#39;: &#39;TimeWindowCompactionStrategy&#39;,&#10;                    &#39;compaction_window_size&#39;: 1,&#10;                    &#39;compaction_window_unit&#39;: &#39;DAYS&#39;};&#10;&#10;-- 查询某传感器某天的数据&#10;SELECT * FROM sensor_data&#10;WHERE sensor_id = &#39;S001&#39; AND bucket = &#39;2024-06-15&#39;&#10;AND event_ts &gt;= &#39;2024-06-15 08:00:00&#39;&#10;AND event_ts &lt; &#39;2024-06-15 18:00:00&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Cassandra 时间序列表设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sensor_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sensor_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bucket     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_ts   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    temperature DOUBLE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    humidity   DOUBLE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((sensor_id, bucket), event_ts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CLUSTERING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event_ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compaction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'class'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TimeWindowCompactionStrategy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                    'compaction_window_size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                    'compaction_window_unit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DAYS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询某传感器某天的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sensor_data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sensor_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'S001'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2024-06-15'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2024-06-15 08:00:00'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2024-06-15 18:00:00'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"写入优化\">写入优化</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批量写入</td>\n<td>合并多个写操作为一次批量提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步写入</td>\n<td>使用异步客户端提升吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compaction 调优</td>\n<td>选择合适的 Compaction 策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩</td>\n<td>启用 LZ4/Snappy 减少 IO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MemTable 调优</td>\n<td>增大 MemTable 大小减少刷盘频率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((列族存储))&#10;    Cassandra&#10;      无中心 P2P&#10;      可调一致性&#10;      CQL 查询&#10;    HBase&#10;      HDFS 底层&#10;      强一致&#10;      Hadoop 生态&#10;    数据建模&#10;      查询驱动设计&#10;      宽表模型&#10;      反规范化&#10;    适用场景&#10;      时间序列&#10;      写密集&#10;      海量数据\">mindmap\n  root((列族存储))\n    Cassandra\n      无中心 P2P\n      可调一致性\n      CQL 查询\n    HBase\n      HDFS 底层\n      强一致\n      Hadoop 生态\n    数据建模\n      查询驱动设计\n      宽表模型\n      反规范化\n    适用场景\n      时间序列\n      写密集\n      海量数据</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>列族存储</strong>以列族组织数据，LSM-Tree 引擎使其写入性能极高。</li>\n<li><strong>Cassandra</strong> 采用无中心架构和可调一致性，适合高可用写密集场景。</li>\n<li><strong>HBase</strong> 基于 HDFS 提供强一致性，适合 Hadoop 大数据生态。</li>\n<li>表设计必须<strong>查询驱动</strong>——为每种查询模式设计专用的表。</li>\n<li><strong>行键设计</strong>是性能的关键，必须避免写入热点（不要以时间戳开头）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"列族存储","id":"列族存储"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Apache Cassandra","id":"apache-cassandra"},{"level":3,"text":"数据模型","id":"数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"Cassandra 架构","id":"cassandra-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"一致性级别","id":"一致性级别"},{"level":2,"text":"Apache HBase","id":"apache-hbase"},{"level":3,"text":"HBase 数据模型","id":"hbase-数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"HBase vs Cassandra","id":"hbase-vs-cassandra"},{"level":2,"text":"宽表模型设计","id":"宽表模型设计"},{"level":3,"text":"设计原则","id":"设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"时间序列数据","id":"时间序列数据"},{"level":2,"text":"写入优化","id":"写入优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文档数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/nosql-and-newdb/document-databases"},"next":{"title":"图数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/nosql-and-newdb/graph-databases"}}